1
00:00:00,083 --> 00:00:03,123
(Howard:)Oh, he speaks English.
He just can't speak to women.

2
00:00:03,879 --> 00:00:05,299
Really? Why?

3
00:00:05,464 --> 00:00:07,214
(Howard:)He's kind of a nerd.

4
00:00:09,968 --> 00:00:11,508
(Howard:)Juice box?

5
00:00:16,141 --> 00:00:18,601
- I'll do the talking.
MAN: Yeah?

6
00:00:18,769 --> 00:00:21,349
- Hi. I'm Leonard, this is Sheldon.
- Hello.

7
00:00:21,521 --> 00:00:22,981
What did I just...?

8
00:00:24,816 --> 00:00:27,656
(Leonard:)- We're here to pick up Penny's TV.
- Get lost.

9
00:00:27,819 --> 00:00:29,199
(Sheldon:)Okay, thanks for your time.

10
00:00:29,362 --> 00:00:32,862
- We're not gonna give up just like that.
- Leonard, the TV's in the building.

11
00:00:33,033 --> 00:00:36,033
(Sheldon:)We've been denied access to the building,
ergo we are done.

12
00:00:36,203 --> 00:00:40,083
(Leonard:)Excuse me. If I were to give up at the first
hitch, I never would have identified...

13
00:00:40,248 --> 00:00:44,168
(Leonard:)...the fingerprints of string theory
in the aftermath of the big bang.

14
00:00:44,920 --> 00:01:01,020
My apologies. What's your plan?

